  "id": "BIT-couchdb-2026-90797",
  "summary": "Apache CouchDB: Pre-authentication gzip decompression bomb via POST /_session",
  "details": "An unlimited gzip decompression routine in chttpd in Apache CouchDB 3.5.2 and below on all platforms allows any remote client to cause a denial of service via memory exhaustion.\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to version 3.5.3, which fixes this issue.",
